  "description": "This is a semi detached house that was granted permission to extend fully i.e. double storey side extension and a double storey rear extension and a loft conversion. This allowed the house to be very big and in current circumstances it is hard to find a tenant who would rent such a big house. \nTherefore, I applied for this house to be converted from one dwelling house into four self contained flats given the dire need for more housing in the borough, however, the application was rejected due to two reasons: drawings I submitted were not accurate and therefore, the sizes were not complaint, so I redid the drawings by a professional architect and now it should all be accurate and compliant as per the london standard house sizes.\n\nI trust your careful consideration to this application will result in issuing an approval especially that we have so many precedents in the same area.\n\nKindest \nMoe\n\n",
